<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL SEES 1996 NET UP AT PLN 23 MLN.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL SEES 1996 NET UP AT PLN 23 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trading company Universal SA sees its net profit rising to 23 million zlotys this year, up from 12 million zlotys last year, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said costs of the planned issue of 100 million zlotys-worth convertible bonds would not lower the forecast.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
